# Leave VITE_API_BASE_URL unset: the UI calls same-origin /api/v1/... paths.
#   - K3s: Traefik routes /api to network-api.
#   - npm run dev: Vite proxies /api to API_PROXY_TARGET (default http://127.0.0.1:8081).
# Set it only to call an API on a different origin (that API must then allow CORS).
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://192.168.137.148:8081
